{{Main|Grand Canyon Brotherhood of Steel}}
The Grand Canyon chapter exists somewhere within the [[Grand Canyon]] as of 2296. It is subordinate to the Commonwealth chapter, and had at least one ''Prydwen''-class airship for transport. That year, the chapter was invited to an alliance with the Knights of San Fernando in an attempt to rebel against the Commonwealth chapter using the cold fusion relic. The Grand Canyon chapter's leader readily agreed.
