====Lyon's Pride==== 
{{Main|Lyons' Pride}}
Lyons' Pride (commonly truncated as the Pride) is a tactical unit within Lyons' Brotherhood of Steel, comprised of elite Brotherhood soldiers led by Sentinel Sarah Lyons.

